Subject: [PATCH 03/13] feat(frontend): documented API layer, controller hook,
 shared components

- api/: typed endpoints, HTTP client (ApiError with status), token store (swappable for
  secure storage on Android), Web Push helper; adds undo + read-all endpoints
- lib/: fixes UTC date bug (IST 'tomorrow' == 'today'), shared file readers replace
  4 copy-pasted FileReader blocks, dose action-window rules mirroring the API
- hooks/useCareApp: container/controller owning all state and actions, provided via
  context (removes 21-prop drilling); hash routing so Back works between tabs
- components/: accessible Modal (focus trap, Escape, bottom sheet on phones), Avatar,
  ImagePickerButtons, Toast (live region), PageHeader, AppNav (single nav source),
  DoseRow (Take/Skip only inside the API window, Undo, busy states), DoseGroup
