Subject: [PATCH 04/13] feat(frontend): rebuild screens on shared components
 with fixed behaviours

- Every button wired and guarded with busy state; real <form>s so Enter submits
- Today always shows today; Calendar pause uses state (no getElementById)
- Medicines: Resume for paused medicines, paused badge, refill state
- Onboarding 'who is this for' screen now reachable for new accounts
- Profile: removed duplicate caregiver-details entry; typed DELETE confirmation
- History/Family: debounced, race-safe search; visible loading and errors
- Notifications: outside-click/Escape dismiss, mark all read, invite deep link
- Sentence-case copy; consistent 'Tended' branding
