From 893d965266289df03dc8c77b05dc4cee9bedc984 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:47:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] feat(ui): healthcare theme, responsive layout system,
 motion, recolored logo

- Token-based CSS split into tokens/base/layout/components/screens/motion
  (replaces a 3,800-line stylesheet with 10+ ad-hoc breakpoints)
- One breakpoint system: phone bottom tabs (safe-area aware), tablet icon rail,
  desktop sidebar; 44px touch targets; visible focus; dialogs as bottom sheets
- Pill-organizer daypart colours for dose groups
- Motion tied to user actions, disabled under prefers-reduced-motion
- Logo/icons recoloured to the teal palette; web manifest; viewport-fit=cover
