From e41fff892d497960b90abc2fe669889b6dcc6201 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:25:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/13] feat(landing): public landing page, auth entry from
 navbar, splash and skeleton loaders

- Landing page for signed-out visitors (signed-in users go straight to the app):
  sticky navbar with Log in / Sign up and phone menu; hero with accessible
  autoplaying carousel of animated product previews (swipe, keys, pause, reduced
  motion); product facts; features; playable pill-organizer demo; how it works;
  audience tabs; reminders; privacy; FAQ accordion; CTA; footer disclaimer
- All copy/media in landingContent.ts: swap in real photos/videos per slide;
