From 606ed3f5c4c9235797d2b3526c4881d7cda14077 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:42:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] feat(app): carry the landing page's visual language
 through every in-app screen

- Dark ink sidebar/rail and floating dark phone tab bar with the day ribbon
- Shared original art: time-of-day SkyScene, illustrated empty states, medicine-form
  tiles (MedicineArt), daypart confetti (Celebration)
- Today: illustrated hero whose sun/moon tracks the real time, gradient adherence
  ring + segmented progress bar, pill-organizer compartments, pill-lift animation
  on Take, celebration when the day's last dose is taken
- Medicines: illustrated tiles, animated supply gauge with refill marker
- Medicine form: live compartment preview of chosen dose times
- History: outcome summary chips and a color-coded Timeline view (Table kept)
- Profile banner, toned action tiles; patient summary banner; family orbit
- Notification settings: sliders + live reminder timeline mirroring the scheduler
- Fix: time picker selects now have accessible names (Hour/Minute/Period)
Flow and every button's behaviour are unchanged; motion respects reduced-motion.
