From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:43:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] feat(app): reschedule flow, patient-wise status,
 skipped vs missed, due-now highlight, activity animations

- Reschedule dialog from any open dose (Just this dose / Whole schedule) or from a
  medicine card, with before -> after preview. Moved originals show 'Moved to ...' with
  struck time and Undo; moved-in doses and rescheduled medicines carry a Rescheduled badge
- No default dose time: time picker starts empty (5-minute steps); a time must be added
- Status reads from the patient's side ('Taken'); 'Recorded by X' only when a caregiver
  recorded it, instead of 'Taken by Priya' on Kamala's dose
- Skipped counted and colored separately from missed (Today stats/bar, History views);
  missed only counts once the 1-hour window closes
- Due-now dose gets a glowing animated border; re-evaluated every 30s while open
- Activity animations: take, skip, undo (rewind), move, new/rescheduled card pop,
  bell ring on new notifications, save button morphs to a check; patient switch crossfade
- Fix: medicine card actions no longer overflow
